      "message": "Not for this CL but it would probably be useful to have a way to post a Message instead of a Runnable on the Handler, otherwise StateMachine like IpClient would need to do 2 Handler loops (one to run the Runnable which would post the message, and the message itself).\n\nArguably only supporting a Message and not a Runnable could work since the caller Handler can run the code in its handleMessage method, but it\u0027s not always convenient.",
